:: Campus Computer Lab
<<initPlayState>>\
<<if !School.isSchoolDay()>><<goto "Linkon University">><</if>>\
<<run World.setLocation("campus-computer-lab", "Bloomshore District — Linkon University")>>\
<<if School.earlyArrival("computerLab")>>\
<<schoolEarly "computerLab">>\
<<else>>\
You stand in the computer lab. Rows of monitors glow under cold fluorescent light; cables snake behind desks toward a server rack humming in the corner.
<</if>>
<<schoolFocus "computerLab">>

<<actionIcon "exit">><<link "Leave the lab <span class='action-time'>(0:01)</span>">><<run World.advance(1)>><<goto "Linkon University">><</link>>
